What every service should import from shared

Every microservice should rely on shared only for infrastructure concerns:

Security (JWT validation, claims, roles, permissions)
Database session and SQLAlchemy base classes
Redis client and cache management
RabbitMQ messaging infrastructure
Common middleware (logging, correlation IDs, exception handling)
Standard API response envelopes
Base exception hierarchy
Shared pagination and sorting schemas
Logging configuration
Generic utilities (IDs, datetime, JSON, validation)